  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Irfan @ Bablu Mainoddin Pathan vs The State Of Maharashtra on 4 September, 2024 Author: Shivkumar Dige Bench: Shivkumar Dige 2024:Bhc-Aug:20811 1 12 In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay, Bench At Aurangabad. 972 Anticipatory Bail Application No. 1280 Of 2024 Irfan @ Bablu Mainoddin Pathan Versus The State Of Maharashtra ... Advocate for Applicant : Mr. Kunte Sachin D. App for Respondent/State : Mrs.D.S. Jape ... Coram : Shivkumar Dige, J. Date : 4th September, 2024. P.C.: 1.",
    "facts": "On secret information, the police conducted raid on his shop and found contraband i.e. Gutka of Rs.12,000/- from his shop. The contraband is Irfan @ Bablu Mainoddin Pathan vs The State Of Maharashtra on 4 September, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/8307355/ 1 already seized from the shop of the applicant. Selling of Gutka is prohibited in the State of Maharashtra.",
    "arguments": "3. It is contention of the learned counsel for the applicant that the applicant has been falsely implicated in this case. The applicant has no criminal antecedents."
  },
